  {
   "text": "Fortnite just put this in the in-game news!",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 2.065
  },
  {
   "text": "Golden Week + Community Day.",
   "t0": 2.315,
   "t1": 3.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Starting 11/28, refreshed loot meets unvaulted Treasure during Golden Week, where each Captain\u2019s golden goods are back in Chests alongside 2X Sprite Dust and XP!",
   "t0": 4.02,
   "t1": 12.565
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, hop aboard for Community Day on 12/5.",
   "t0": 12.815,
   "t1": 15.327
  },
  {
   "text": "What do you think? Tell me in the comments.",
   "t0": 15.527,
   "t1": 17.182
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 17.382,
   "t1": 20.422
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for watching! Follow for more daily content.",
   "t0": 20.702,
   "t1": 23.151
  }
 ],
